# 📊 Data Cleaning & Reporting Automation

## 📌 Project Overview

This project was completed as part of the **Thiranex Data Analytics Internship**.

The objective of this task was to develop a structured workflow for **data cleaning, validation, automated reporting, and visual analysis** using an airfare dataset.

The project processes **11,536 valid airfare records** and organizes the results into cleaned data, automated reports, and visual summaries.

> ⚠️ **Dataset Note:** The airfare records in this project are synthetic prototype data created for testing and demonstration. They are not live airline or OTA fare quotes.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Clean and preprocess airfare data
- Identify missing and duplicate records
- Validate data quality
- Detect potential outliers
- Generate automated statistical reports
- Analyze airfare by airline and route
- Analyze fares based on number of stops
- Create visual summaries for easier interpretation

